{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Pushed for review — Gerrit change 2657\n\nhttps://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2657 — \"Partition the inbound fetch by created\nwindow\" (`af6fbfed9f8f`, 3 files, +527/-2).\n\nTicket left `in_progress` and the change left unsubmitted, per instruction: the operator\nverifies the votes and submits.\n\n### Gates run locally before push\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `make lint` (ruff check + format-check, zizmor, actionlint) | pass |\n| `make typecheck` (mypy, 762 source files) | pass |\n| complexity ratchet | `active=33 new=0 increased=0 stale=16` |\n| mechanism-delta ratchet | `active=684 new=0 increased=0 stale=0` |\n| `make verify` (full suite) | **19,449 passed, 72 skipped, 1 failed** in 50:21 |\n| module size | `fetch_paging.py` 391, `fetcher.py` 650 (cap 800; 650 is the explicit target `test_fetch_paging_split.py` asserts) |\n\n### The one failure, reported not papered over\n\n`tests/unit/test_completion_wrapper_duration_instrumentation.py::test_verify_completion_partitions_attempt_without_changing_verdict`\nfailed with `GateCongestedError: gate admission refused: all 4 concurrent slots busy`, then\n**passed in isolation** (`7 passed in 97.62s`). It is a unit test coupled to a host-wide gate\nadmission semaphore, contended by the other agent sessions running on this box. Zero overlap\nwith this change (the file contains no reference to `fetch_paging`, `fetcher`,\n`collect_partitioned` or `_ACLI_CEILING`).\n\nFiled as `torrential-unwhite-snail` (`9c2e-b44c-119e-4105`), linked `discovered_from` this\nticket, rather than retried into green.\n\n### No gate refusals\n\n`claim` succeeded without a plan-review block, and no `--force` or bypass was used on any\nsurface at any point.\n\n### What was NOT done, deliberately\n\n- **No live `rebar bridge run`** (AC2). Running the reconciler against live Jira is a bridge\n  write to a third-party system and the operator's call. Only read-only\n  `POST /rest/api/3/search/approximate-count` and `GET .../search/jql` calls were made, for the\n  measurements above.\n- **Change not submitted, ticket not closed.**"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788578469416107275,"uuid":"241c6042-6915-447b-8a89-b0a5ad00763b"}